<p class="govuk-body">Each template is one of the app’s screens as it is today, or a few that link to each other, written as whole pages to start a prototype from. Copy its folder from <code>templates/</code> in the repository, then change it: a comment at the top of each page says what to change, and what to leave as the app has it.</p>

<p class="govuk-body">Templates are iOS only for now.</p>

<ul class="govuk-list">
  {% for template in templates %}
  <li class="govuk-!-margin-bottom-6">
    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m govuk-!-margin-bottom-1"><a class="govuk-link" href="/templates/{{ template.slug }}/about/">{{ template.name | escape }}</a></h2>
    <p class="govuk-body govuk-!-margin-bottom-0">{{ template.purpose | escape }}</p>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
